<SNAP stateVersion="2" order="shift,press,drive,space" name="crack from the rim" tags="Punchy,Bright,Snare" description="makes snares and claps crack: a short sizzle layer on each hit, punch compression, cassette spark on the attack only, a little booth and clipped peaks.">
